WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.858
Open the trading screen.

2
00:00:01.978 --> 00:00:03.951
Click Simulator and select Apple.

3
00:00:04.071 --> 00:00:08.704
Read the generated candlestick chart and the current virtual quote before placing an order.

4
00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:16.337
Review a buy order.

5
00:00:16.457 --> 00:00:23.319
Enter one share, click Review buy, and inspect the quantity, estimated cost, and remaining virtual cash.

6
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.605
Confirm the purchase.

7
00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.933
Click Confirm buy.

8
00:00:27.053 --> 00:00:31.372
Read the trade breakdown, then close it to return to the chart and your position.

9
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:33.444
Sell the position.

10
00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:38.243
Select Sell, enter one share, review the order, and confirm the sale.

11
00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:41.301
The breakdown explains the completed virtual trade.

